Package: printer-driver-aimotech
Source: printer-driver-aimotech
Version: 0.3.6
Section: text
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: cups, python3, python3-pil
Recommends: bluez, poppler-utils
Suggests: cups-bsd, system-config-printer
Maintainer: remote_codes pack <remote-codes@example.com>
Description: CUPS driver for Aimotech D30 Print Master label printers
 Userspace CUPS backend (aimotech://), filter (rastertoaimotech), and
 PPD/drv for Aimotech / Quin / Phomemo D30 ESC/POS GS v 0 over RFCOMM
 channel 1 (Print Master app family).
 .
 Install this package as root once. An lpadmin user then creates a
 queue. Users allowed by the CUPS print policy (lp/lpr on Debian) print
 without root. The backend is mode 0700 and runs as root so job
 submitters do not need the bluetooth group.
 .
 Framing is recovered from Print Master 5.23.1. Live D30 eject is
 unproven in this pack revision.
